<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India rise in February.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India rise in February.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver re-exports from Dubai in the United Arab Emirates to India rose to 31.33 tonnes in February from 20.52 tonnes in January, according to figures compiled by the statistics section of Dubai customs.</p>
<p>Re-exports to Pakistan rose to 5.68 tonnes from 2.81 tonnes in January, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
